#N canvas 20 20 2700 1700 12;
#X declare -lib pdlua;
#X text 20 20 u_song -- the song: its sections \, which one plays and which is queued \, the draft and the saved song \, and their two files. It knows nothing about what a part's key means: a part puts its own on the state bus with the section policy \, put section <key> <atoms...> \, which lands in the section playing \, and a section starting sends every part it holds back \, restore <key> <atoms...>. ref/module/songs.md, f 72;
#X text 20 190 creation arg 1: the state directory \, u_state's: the saved song is cut-it-song.txt there and the draft cut-it-song-draft.txt. inlet 1: u_map's top row and save and revert -- top <1-8> \, save \, revert. inlet 2: the phone's sections page \, from u_net. inlet 3: bar \, from c_steps \, on the global loop's last step: a bar is the pattern's loop (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). inlet 4: a bang meaning LOAD NOW \, from u_init after u_state's restore \, because startup order is u_init's. outlet 1: to g_grid -- top <8 lamps> and unsaved <0 or 1>. outlet 2: the phone's state \, to u_net., f 72;
#X obj 20 420 inlet;
